  "body_html": "<p>Maresciallo, la tua Squadra conta di base una mezza dozzina di membri. Trattala come un seguace con il tag <em>gruppo</em> . Tutti i valori iniziali qui indicati possono cambiare durante il gioco.</p>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"crew\" data-hp-key=\"crew\" data-label=\"Crew\">\n<h2 id=\"the-crew\">La Squadra</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"HP max\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">HP max</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Armatura\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Armatura</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"Danno\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"Tira il danno\">Danno</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<p class=\"fs-gloss\">Gli HP partono da 6 ciascuno; l'Armatura da 0; il Danno da d6.</p>\n<h3 id=\"tags\">Tag</h3>\n<p>La tua squadra inizia con <em>gruppo</em>, un tag concesso dal tuo passato, più altri 2 a tua scelta.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag0\" data-check-id=\"tag0\"> <span><em>arcieri</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag1\" data-check-id=\"tag1\"> <span><em>atletici</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag2\" data-check-id=\"tag2\"> <span><em>coraggiosi</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag3\" data-check-id=\"tag3\"> <span><em>astuti</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag4\" data-check-id=\"tag4\"> <span><em>devoti</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled aria-label=\"Già segnato\"> <span><em>gruppo</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag6\" data-check-id=\"tag6\"> <span><em>robusti</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag7\" data-check-id=\"tag7\"> <span><em>intimidatori</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag8\" data-check-id=\"tag8\"> <span><em>attenti</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag9\" data-check-id=\"tag9\"> <span><em>pazienti</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag10\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag10\" data-check-id=\"tag10\"> <span><em>rispettati</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag11\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag11\" data-check-id=\"tag11\"> <span><em>furtivi</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag12\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag12\" data-check-id=\"tag12\"> <span><em>guerrieri</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank0\" data-check-id=\"tagblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"scrivilo tu\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank1\" data-check-id=\"tagblank1\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank1\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"scrivilo tu\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank2\" data-check-id=\"tagblank2\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank2\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"scrivilo tu\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"exc0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"exc0\" data-check-id=\"exc0\"> <span><em>eccezionali</em> (richiede Eroi Fino all'Ultimo)</span></label></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"instinct\">Istinto</h3>\n<p>Scegline 1.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst0\" data-check-id=\"inst0\"> <span>Litigare, azzuffarsi e serbare rancore</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst1\" data-check-id=\"inst1\"> <span>Attenersi a tradizione e superstizione</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst2\" data-check-id=\"inst2\"> <span>Cedere ai loro istinti più bassi</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst3\" data-check-id=\"inst3\"> <span>Fare i padroni con gli altri</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst4\" data-check-id=\"inst4\"> <span>Correre rischi inutili</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst5\" data-check-id=\"inst5\"> <span>Esagerare sempre</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"instblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"instblank0\" data-check-id=\"instblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:instblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"scrivilo tu\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"cost\">Costo</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><p>Scegline 1.</p><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"crew-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">Lealtà</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-0\" title=\"Lealtà 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"Lealtà 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-1\" title=\"Lealtà 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"Lealtà 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-2\" title=\"Lealtà 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"Lealtà 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost0\" data-check-id=\"cost0\"> <span>Far baldoria, in gruppo</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost1\" data-check-id=\"cost1\"> <span>Riconoscimento pubblico e rispetto, onore</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost2\" data-check-id=\"cost2\"> <span>Rischi corsi, da te, per aiutarli</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost3\" data-check-id=\"cost3\"> <span>Vittorie conquistate contro nemici degni</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost4\" data-check-id=\"cost4\"> <span>Ricchezze guadagnate per sé o per Stonetop</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"costblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"costblank0\" data-check-id=\"costblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:costblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"scrivilo tu\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"inventory\">Inventario</h3>\n<p>3 ◇ o meno è un carico leggero; 4–6 ◇ è un carico normale; 7–9 ◇ è un carico pesante.</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-inventory\"><li>◇ <strong>Accetta</strong>, ferro (<em>mano</em>, <em>da lancio</em>, x perforante)</li><li>◇ <strong>Lancia</strong>, ferro (<em>vicino</em>, <em>da lancio</em>, x perforante)</li><li>◇ <strong>Arco e frecce di ferro</strong> (<em>presso</em>, x perforante, ○ poche munizioni, ○ esaurite)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>Scudo</strong> (+1 armatura, +1 Prontezza con 7+ per Difendere)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>Pelli spesse</strong> (1 armatura, <em>caldo</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>Mantello</strong> (<em>caldo</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>Scorte</strong> (4+Prosperità usi per membro della squadra)</li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-a-\"><span class=\"track-label\">Scorte</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" title=\"Uso 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" aria-label=\"Uso 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" title=\"Uso 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" aria-label=\"Uso 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" title=\"Uso 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" aria-label=\"Uso 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" title=\"Uso 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" aria-label=\"Uso 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" title=\"Uso 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" aria-label=\"Uso 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" title=\"Uso 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" aria-label=\"Uso 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" title=\"Uso 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" aria-label=\"Uso 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" title=\"Uso 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" aria-label=\"Uso 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-b-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" title=\"Uso 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" aria-label=\"Uso 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" title=\"Uso 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" aria-label=\"Uso 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" title=\"Uso 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" aria-label=\"Uso 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" title=\"Uso 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" aria-label=\"Uso 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" title=\"Uso 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" aria-label=\"Uso 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" title=\"Uso 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" aria-label=\"Uso 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" title=\"Uso 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" aria-label=\"Uso 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" title=\"Uso 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" aria-label=\"Uso 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-c-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" title=\"Uso 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" aria-label=\"Uso 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" title=\"Uso 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" aria-label=\"Uso 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" title=\"Uso 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" aria-label=\"Uso 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" title=\"Uso 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" aria-label=\"Uso 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" title=\"Uso 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" aria-label=\"Uso 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" title=\"Uso 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" aria-label=\"Uso 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" title=\"Uso 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" aria-label=\"Uso 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" title=\"Uso 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" aria-label=\"Uso 8\"></label></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-gear\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Altro equipaggiamento</span><ul><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear0\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear2\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear3\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear4\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear5\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul></div>\n<h3 id=\"individuals\">Individui</h3>\n<p>Quando uno di loro si distingue, dagli un nome, un tag e uno o più tratti.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-people\"><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nome</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nome\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tag</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"tag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tratti</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"tratti\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nome</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nome\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tag</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"tag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tratti</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"tratti\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nome</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nome\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tag</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"tag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tratti</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"tratti\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nome</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nome\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tag</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"tag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tratti</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"tratti\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nome</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nome\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tag</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"tag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tratti</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"tratti\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nome</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nome\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tag</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"tag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tratti</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"tratti\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>Nomi:</strong> Aled, Culhwich, Eira, Gerat, Glaw, Harri, Lowri, Mervyn, Nesta</p>\n<p><strong>Tag:</strong> <em>amante degli animali, grosso, attaccabrighe, cinico, ubriacone, zelante, giocatore d'azzardo, avido, burbero, credulone, rubacuori, onesto, gentile, licenzioso, piccoletto, ingenuo, vecchio, benvoluto, orgoglioso, recluta, spericolato, senza vergogna, occhio acuto, collerico</em></p>\n<p><strong>Tratti:</strong> figlio/fratello/genitore/cugino di ___, calvo, cotta per ___, rancore verso ___, odia ___, idolatra ___, scherza sempre, disordinato, gli manca un occhio/dito/mano/___, gli mancano i figli, incubi, sposato da poco, religioso, cicatrici, mingherlino, lingua tagliente, canta, russa, racconta storie incredibili, troppo serio, guai a casa, fischietta, intaglia il legno</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Note</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"Note\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"order-followers\">Comandare i Seguaci</h3>\n<p>Quando <strong><em>ordini loro di fare una mossa e loro la fanno</em></strong>, tira +1 invece di +STAT se uno dei loro tag si applica (o +2 se sono anche <em>eccezionali</em>). Se nessun tag si applica, tira +0. Se uno dei loro tag è d'intralcio, tira con svantaggio.</p>\n<p>Quando sono <strong><em>senza ordini</em></strong> o <strong><em>agiscono di propria iniziativa</em></strong>, il GM dice cosa fanno e come va.</p>\n<h3 id=\"strengthen-your-bond\">Rafforzare il legame</h3>\n<p>Quando <strong><em>paghi il loro costo</em></strong> e non l'hai fatto di recente, tengono +1 Lealtà (max 3).</p>\n<p>Spendi la loro Lealtà 1 a 1 per far sì che:</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Superino la paura e facciano ciò che dici</li><li>Resistano all'impulso di agire secondo istinto/tag/tratti</li><li>Facciano qualcosa che non vogliono fare (purché non sia ripugnante o suicida)</li></ul>"
}
